9,ut-Ma’in | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/gel/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q5KWmiaP4Tv7jDnwn9UDYN2R3n2-3ul1HIRRBoa7RcU,ut-Ma’in is a stable indigenous language of Nigeria. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,ut-Ma’in,Niger-Congo
